# Git

One repository. Root is this directory. Do not `git init` in `ws_simulacra/`
or `src/`. Do not treat the Cursor workspace (`/home/aj/code`) as this repo.

| Remote | URL |
|--------|-----|
| `origin` | `git@github.com:yojuna/g1-simulacrum.git` |

Integration branch: **`main`**. Topic branches: `31-git-hygiene.mdc`.

## Local identity (this repo only)

Already set. **Never** `git config --global`. Host default stays
`a.chakraborty` / haverboecker.

```
user.name  = yojuna
user.email = datamongeraami@gmail.com
core.sshCommand = ssh -i ~/.ssh/yojuna -o IdentitiesOnly=yes
```

`Host github.com` in `~/.ssh/config` is a different account. Pushes to
`yojuna/*` must use this repo’s `core.sshCommand`.

## Do not

- `git push` unless asked.
- Amend, force-push, or skip hooks unless asked.
- Commit `.env`, checkpoints, `docker/home/`, or a host `.venv`.
- Use the haverboecker identity on commits here.

Git itself runs on the host. Python runtime is Docker (`40-docker-tooling.mdc`).
